 that supports you have a  routine that supports you schedule  things in that logically makes sense it  if you do these things that'll help you  with your goals but then don't always  stick to that that's not you know gospel  when days come when you're creative and  want to try something follow that flow  because that's likely going to create  some magic for you now this this series  is about my book and me right  look and usually after go my rent like  this I answer your questions and there  were no questions last week there were  no question because all you guys wanted  to talk about was my beard all you  wanted to talk about was my beard so I  shaved it off no more beard back to  business and if you have a question you  want me to answer about my book or about  the book writing process that you're  going through and you want to advice or  help leave in the comments below and  next week I'll make a video response so  thank you guys have a fantastic week  continue to believe I look forward your  comments and I'll see you soon
 

